{"beat": 6, "name": "UTICA", "text": "So he tried it. On February 22, 1879, Washington's Birthday, he opened the Great Five Cent Store in Utica, New York, with about $300 of goods on credit from Moore. The daily takings fell as low as $2.50. Within about 3 months he'd sold out and closed, at a profit, by his own account, of $150. Decades later he said what he took from it: One of the first things I learned was that I could not expect people to come to me. I had to take my store to the people. He took the lesson to Lancaster.", "provider": "placeholder", "words": [{"word": "So", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.16}, {"word": "he", "start": 0.16, "end": 0.28}, {"word": "tried", "start": 0.28, "end": 0.62}, {"word": "it.", "start": 0.62, "end": 0.84}, {"word": "On", "start": 1.4, "end": 1.56}, {"word": "February", "start": 1.56, "end": 1.9}, {"word": "22,", "start": 1.9, "end": 2.58}, {"word": "1879,", "start": 3.12, "end": 4.9}, {"word": "Washington's", "start": 5.68, "end": 6.32}, {"word": "Birthday,", "start": 6.32, "end": 6.68}, {"word": "he", "start": 7.28, "end": 7.38}, {"word": "opened", "start": 7.38, "end": 7.68}, {"word": "the", "start": 7.68, "end": 7.92}, {"word": "Great", "start": 7.92, "end": 8.1}, {"word": "Five", "start": 8.1, "end": 8.46}, {"word": "Cent", "start": 8.46, "end": 8.8}, {"word": "Store", "start": 8.8, "end": 9.18}, {"word": "in", "start": 9.18, "end": 9.4}, {"word": "Utica,", "start": 9.4, "end": 9.84}, {"word": "New", "start": 10.08, "end": 10.18}, {"word": "York,", "start": 10.18, "end": 10.6}, {"word": "with", "start": 10.92, "end": 11.16}, {"word": "about", "start": 11.16, "end": 11.4}, {"word": "$300", "start": 11.84, "end": 12.5}, {"word": "of", "start": 12.5, "end": 12.74}, {"word": "goods", "start": 12.74, "end": 13.06}, {"word": "on", "start": 13.06, "end": 13.32}, {"word": "credit", "start": 13.32, "end": 13.68}, {"word": "from", "start": 13.68, "end": 13.94}, {"word": "Moore.", "start": 13.94, "end": 14.2}, {"word": "The", "start": 14.94